{"agenda_id": 372, "attachments": [], "category": "Town Council", "date": "2026-09-30", "description": "A. Private meeting with legal counsel to discuss PBA negotiations.\ni. Mayor announces the commencement of the Executive Session with an estimated length of up to 45 minutes.\nii. Mayor announces the names of each Councilmember in attendance, the Town Manager Kathleen Gunn, Finance/HR Director Emily Alves, and Town Attorney Gemma Torcivia or Zachery Good.\niii. Mayor closes the session to the public.\niv. Discussion\nv. Mayor announces the termination of the Executive Session.", "event_id": 477, "fiscal_impact": "", "is_section": true, "item_id": 88, "item_number": "", "key": "civicclerk:junobeachfl:item:88", "level": 0, "meeting": "CLOSED EXECUTIVE SESSION", "ordinance_number": "", "outline": "", "portal_url": "https://junobeachfl.portal.civicclerk.com/event/477/files", "resolution_number": "", "section": "BUSINESS", "title": "BUSINESS"}
